Adds Renderer::setTileCacheSize, the number of tiles each source keeps once
they leave the view, so a renderer that draws unrelated views can keep few or
none. setTileCacheEnabled(false) is the same as a size of 0, and
setTileCacheEnabled(true) restores the default size. Temporary: drop this
patch when the submodule moves to a core that includes the pull request.
Upstream: https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native/pull/4867 at 009c9472

